 # Changelog
 
-Compared with version **1.1.0**, published **October 3, 2026**. Previous Daytime PDF SHA-256: `115003a4a47c92d10d0a59b0e43cbbb2401a19bb6ea606d95c037d0d7697801c`.
-
-**Deprecation or removal — Orientation, capstone and product appendices.** Replaced the Data Pipeline Studio assignment and Simple Design System reference with Velori: a preserved configurator, one Review configuration extension, and a portable React sample. One supplied product now carries the source, state, implementation and native Figma checks through the capstone. [Source](https://handbooks.surfaces.systems/claude-design/velori-store-0.2.0-mit-release.zip).
-
-**Addition — Chapters 2–3.** Added source definition and conflict records, CSS and prop inventories, controlled import scope, asset hashes recorded before validation, fidelity checks of ten elements, and named correction fixtures followed by a second generation. Readers can resolve source disagreements and verify reuse before introducing the review screen. [Source](https://support.claude.com/en/articles/14604397-set-up-your-design-system-in-claude-design).
-
-**Correction or clarification — Chapters 4–7 and 10.** Specified retention of all four configuration values, keyboard and return focus, image recovery, narrow layouts, and native Figma component/variable correspondence. Detail photographs remain Chalk, and prototype visits are distinguished from browser reload persistence. These contracts expose state loss and unsupported claims of parity between tools. [Source](https://www.figma.com/design/jdGjI8zBJrvpMERKpBSCli?node-id=34-694).
-
-**Correction or clarification — Chapter 9.** Corrected the local Code handoff to Copy prompt and authenticated source reads. Truncated binaries require a full native archive; captured bytes stay private and unchanged, host adaptations are disclosed, and each new packet is validated independently. Complete source and dependency bytes are required before executable handoff acceptance. [Source](https://support.claude.com/en/articles/14604416-get-started-with-claude-design).
+Compared with version **1.2.0**, published **October 5, 2026**. Previous Daytime PDF SHA-256: `fa7a27cd0db1f855daba23cb1269e08fc6098391032623f9a9252eef1f44f05c`.
+
+**Correction or clarification — Orientation, Chapter 10 and exercise materials.** Replaced the owner-file access prerequisite with a downloadable Velori Figma companion imported into the reader's own Drafts. Navigation uses verified page and frame names; each import records native identities and checks local dependencies and the prototype journey. Readers can complete the existing Figma exercise without access to the author's file. [Source](https://handbooks.surfaces.systems/claude-design/editions/v1.2.1/velori-design-system-configurator.fig).
